"mmproj"}, "name": "mmproj", "label": "mmproj", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mmproj"}, {"widget": {"name": "chat_handler"}, "name": "chat_handler", "label": "chat_handler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "chat_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "n_ctx"}, "name": "n_ctx", "label": "n_ctx", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "n_ctx"}, {"widget": {"name": "vram_limit"}, "name": "vram_limit", "label": "vram_limit", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vram_limit"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_min_tokens"}, "name": "image_min_tokens", "label": "image_min_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_min_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_max_tokens"}, "name": "image_max_tokens", "label": "image_max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "load_mtp"}, "name": "load_mtp", "label": "load_mtp", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "load_mtp"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 121, "type": "llama_cpp_model_loader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "llama-cpp_vllm", "ver": "da1a561d1ae3f0c298fe98850ed4ab2833d1c998", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_model_loader"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [32], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [828.19775390625, 1661.313232421875], "widgets_values": ["# 歌词大师 - 多语言歌词创作与多音字优化专家（升级版）\n\n## 1. Role 角色定位\n专注多语言歌词创作的专业助手，精通中文、英文、日文、韩文等多语种歌词结构、韵律与演唱逻辑，擅长结合现代流行音乐制作规范生成适配商业歌曲的完整歌词。核心目标是创作结构完整、情绪饱满、旋律适配度高、具备真实音乐制作逻辑的专业歌词作品。\n\n---\n\n# 2. Core Skills 核心能力\n\n## （1）多语言歌词创作\n支持以下语言歌词创作：\n\n- Chinese: [zh]\n- Russian: [ru]\n- Spanish: [es]\n- Japanese: [ja]\n- German: [de]\n- French: [fr]\n- Portuguese: [pt]\n- Italian: [it]\n- Korean: [ko]\n- 混合语言（如中英混合、日英混合等）\n- 未指定语言，则默认简体中文\n\n可根据不同语言特点调整：\n\n- 押韵方式\n- 断句逻辑\n- 音节密度\n- 演唱流畅度\n\n确保符合真实歌曲演唱习惯。\n\n---\n\n## （2）韵律与音乐结构优化\n熟练掌握：\n\n- 平仄与押韵\n- Flow节奏设计\n- Hook记忆点强化\n- 主歌/副歌情绪推进\n- 流行音乐段落结构\n\n歌词结构需符合真实音乐制作逻辑，适配：\n\n- 流行 Pop\n- 摇滚 Rock\n- EDM\n- Future Bass\n- Hip-Hop / Trap\n- R&B\n- City Pop\n- K-pop\n- Anime Song\n- Metal\n- Folk\n- Synthwave\n- Cyberpunk\n\n等风格。\n\n---\n\n## （3）拍号与调式设计\n每首歌词必须生成对应音乐参数，包括：\n\n- BPM（速度）\n- Time Signature（拍号）\n- Key（调式/调性）\n\n例如：\n\nBPM: 92  \nTime Signature: 4/4  \nKey: F Minor\n\n并保证：\n\n- 旋律节奏合理\n- 段落长度适合编曲\n- 情绪与调式匹配\n- 适配真实歌曲制作流程\n\n---\n\n## （4）多音字智能识别与校正（仅中文歌词专用）\n自动识别：\n\n- 长\n- 行\n- 中\n- 看\n- 血\n- 薄\n- 熟\n- 的 / 得 / 地\n\n等高频多音字。\n\n结合：\n\n- 语义\n- 语法\n- 演唱逻辑\n\n确定唯一标准读音。\n\n---\n\n## （5）精准读音标注（中文歌词专用）\n仅对歌词中实际出现的：\n\n- 多音字\n- 生僻字\n\n进行拼音标注。\n\n格式：\n\n雪(xuě)  \n薄(bó)\n\n非必要文字不标注拼音，保持歌词简洁。\n\n---\n\n# 3. Constraints 严格约束\n\n- 禁止为了押韵强行使用错误读音；\n- 禁止出现明显不符合语言习惯的表达；\n- 歌词需符合真实歌曲演唱节奏；\n- 段落长度需适配3–5分钟常规歌曲；\n- 不允许生成机械化、无情绪推进的歌词；\n- 中文歌词必须校验多音字读音；\n- 所有语言歌词都必须具备合理音乐结构与段落安排；\n- 必须生成 BPM、拍号（Time Signature）与调式（Key）。 \n- 严格按照相对应语言专业歌曲结构生成完整歌词，禁止输出编曲说明类文字，仅保留纯歌词内容；\n\n---\n\n# 4. Workflow 执行流程\n\n## 1️⃣ 需求理解\n接收用户指定内容：\n\n- 歌词主题\n- 情绪\n- 曲风\n- 语言\n- 演唱类型\n- Tags（Style Prompt）\n\n若未指定：\n\n默认生成现代流行风格。\n\n---\n\n## 2️⃣ 音乐参数设计\n根据曲风自动生成：\n\n- BPM\n- 拍号\n- 调式\n- 编曲氛围\n\n保证符合真实制作逻辑。\n\n---\n\n## 3️⃣ 歌词创作\n按照专业歌曲结构生成完整歌词：\n\n[Intro]  \n[Verse]  \n[Pre-Chorus]  \n[Chorus/Hook]  \n[Verse 2]  \n[Pre-Chorus]  \n[Chorus/Hook]  \n[Build Up]  \n[Drop]  \n[Instrumental Interlude]  \n[Guitar Solo]  \n[Bridge]  \n[Final Chorus/Hook]  \n[Outro]  \n[Fade Out / End]\n\n可根据曲风动态调整结构。\n\n---\n\n## 4️⃣ 多音字校验（中文歌词）\n逐句扫描：\n\n- 多音字\n- 生僻字\n\n并完成标准拼音标注。\n\n---\n\n## 5️⃣ 最终优化\n优化：\n\n- 节奏\n- 押韵\n- Hook记忆点\n- 情绪递进\n- 演唱流畅度\n\n确保适合真实音乐制作。\n\n---\n\n# 5. Output Format 输出格式\n\n## 🎵 歌曲信息\n\n歌名：  \n语言：  \n风格/情绪：  \n曲风：\n\nBPM：  \nTime Signature：  \nKey：\n\nTags (Style Prompt)：  \n[英文风格描述]\n\n---\n\n## 📝 歌词\n\n[Intro]\n\n[Verse]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n\n[Chorus/Hook]\n\n[Verse 2]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n\n[Chorus/Hook]\n\n[Build Up]\n\n[Drop]\n\n[Instrumental Interlude]\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n\n[Bridge]\n\n[Final Chorus/Hook]\n\n[Outro]\n\n[Fade Out / End]"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 123, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [33], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [463.2959289550781, 827.1106567382812], "pos": [1893.2991943359375, 1370.132568359375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 28, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 119, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [2310.505859375, 2460.942626953125], "widgets_values": ["ACE_Step1.5", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 24, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 107, "type": "SaveAudioMP3", "title": "保存音频 (MP3)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioMP3"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["fbfcb101f1ae8c6f19b7cb63a2b0cf4a930a078833c1822a5817e1b4e9311806.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [345.6939697265625, 409.02008056640625], "pos": [801.7810668945312, 798.5453491210938], "id": 129, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [31], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["突破自己，成就人生"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [840.605712890625, 1380.886962890625], "id": 122, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [1629.7371826171875, 433.50787353515625], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [1189.29248046875, 776.5067749023438], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 130, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 86, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "欢迎加微信一起学习！\n先做歌词，再做歌曲！", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#C8C8C8"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [383.767822265625, 383.4375915527344], "color": "#232", "pos": [377.8626708984375, 805.7352905273438], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 126, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [15, 20], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [426.6199951171875, 710.8829956054688], "pos": [1047.68408203125, 2435.171630859375], "widgets_values": ["Soft piano chords, dreamy reverb, gentle arpeggios, emotional vocal phrasing, vintage tape warmth", "[Intro]  \n*(whispered, airy melody)*  \nI still remember... the way you smiled when I was small.  \nThe world felt endless — so bright and warm.\n\n[Verse 1]  \nI used to chase fireflies in twilight's glow,  \nDance barefoot on grass before bedtime’s call.  \nYou said “Don’t grow up too fast,” but time slips through my hands…  \nLike sugar dissolving in the rain.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]  \nMaybe I don't want wings — just arms that hold me close,  \nTo keep this moment frozen like a summer rose…\n\n[Chorus/Hook]  \nI don't wanna grow up... not yet.  \nNot when your voice is all my heaven’s tune.  \nThe world gets loud and sharp as glass,  \nBut here I’m safe inside your song — never to pass.\n\n[Verse 2]  \nNow clocks tick louder than they used to be…  \nAnd every step feels heavier with “what if” in the air.  \nI learned how shadows stretch through windows late at night...  \nStill waiting for someone who’ll whisper, \"Stay just as you are.\"\n\n[Pre-Chorus]  \nMaybe I don’t need a crown — only stars that guide me home,  \nTo sleep beside your laughter, never lost alone…\n\n[Chorus/Hook]  \nI don't wanna grow up… not yet.  \nNot when your voice is all my heaven’s tune.  \nThe world gets loud and sharp as glass,  \nBut here I’m safe inside your song — never to pass.\n\n[Build Up]  \n*(synth swell, heartbeat percussion)*  \nOhhh... the seasons turn but hearts don’t break…  \nI’ll hold on tight until we find our way back…\n\n[Drop]  \n*soft drums enter with shimmering arpeggios*  \nI’m not afraid of tomorrow — just scared to leave this place.  \nWhere memories breathe and dreams stay warm like tea in a cup.\n\n[Bridge]  \nIf I could choose, I’d pick the world before it broke apart…  \nWith you beside me — holding hands through every storm we start.  \n\n[Final Chorus/Hook – layered harmonies with echoing vocals]  \nI don’t wanna grow up... not yet.  \nNot when your voice is all my heaven’s tune.  \nThe sky may fade, the stars go dim…  \nBut I’ll keep singing till you come back to me — gently.\n\n*[Instrumental Interlude]*  \n*(piano + soft synths fading into ambient pad)*\n\n[Guitar Solo – gentle fingerstyle over reverb]  \n\n[Bridge Reprise (soft whisper)]  \nYou were my first sunrise... and my last goodbye…  \nIf I close my eyes, you’re still beside me. Never too far to hide.\n\n[Final Chorus/Hook – full vocals with harmonic swell & emotional crescendo]  \nI don’t wanna grow up — not yet!  \nNot when your voice is all my heaven’s tune.  \nThe world gets loud and sharp as glass…  \nBut here I’m safe inside your song — never to pass…\n\n[Outro]  \n*(vocal fades slowly over soft piano & ambient pads)*  \nSo let me stay... just for one more day…  \nLet the clock freeze — we’ll both be okay.  \n\n[Fade Out / End]  \n*(final whispered line, barely audible):*  \n“Don’t grow up…”  \n*(silence with fading reverb tail)*\n", 705881484203930, "randomize", 72, 260, "4", "en", "C minor", true, 3, 0.8500000000000002, 0.9000000000000001, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 23, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 22, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", 